id: "f0f57622-4e80-44a2-b4ba-751e83fa768d"
title: "Right price on the spreadsheet, wrong margin in the result: the new challenge for e-commerce pricing"
slug: "ai-pricing-ecommerce-margem-giro-conversao"
language: "en"
type: "i6 Article"
date: "2026-07-16"
excerpt: "Understand how AI Pricing helps e-commerce stores transform pricing into a dynamic decision, connecting margin, turnover, conversion, stock, and governance."
cover_image: "/insights-assets/8ef408b91890e9a8.png"
cta_form_subtitle: "**Would you like to learn more?** Fill in the form and let's get in touch!"
cta_form_text: "**Would you like to learn more?** Fill in the form and let's get in touch!"
theme: "preco-elasticidade"
theme_label: "Price & Elasticity"
read_time: 6
